// Two corals; seeds in the bottom corners past a wall with two gaps.
name Reef Walk
rule B1/S12345678
steps 4
hint Two corals, two seeds lying in the far corners. The wall between has a gap at each end.
tip Nothing dies under this law, so each origin is still alive at the heart of its coral, eight cells apart.
intro The corals here grew towards each other and never quite met. The seeds that started them were left where the reef ends.
outro What never dies still needs to have begun.
